    "hidden_defect": "no",
    "rationale": "Alternate definitions' calls are lost from the merged flow and consequently from aggregated call relations, establishing the core defect. First-definition precedence for scalar metadata is documented at codebase.rs:66-70, but does not justify discarding alternate control-flow content."
